From: lizhenneng <lizhenneng@kylinos.cn>
Date: Tue, 24 Mar 2026 13:45:39 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 01/20] fix: glenfly gpu unload model failed

After unload model by kytensor, glenfly gpu's vram can not be recycled.
Fix memory leak for decrypted lora.

Bug: #507905

Req: yes

From: kylin

Severity: Critical

Tested-by: lizhenneng@kylinos.cn
Change-Id: I1d91b797445590d98d6e36db05221da2bd56960b
Signed-off-by: lizhenneng <lizhenneng@kylinos.cn>
